Cooling Capacity Accounting
Copyright 2026 Summon Software Labs.

This product includes software developed by Summon Software Labs.

The Cooling Capacity Accounting source tree contains no third-party source
code. It builds and tests with a C++20 compiler and CMake alone, with no
network access and no downloaded dependencies. The only non-standard-library
interfaces it uses are operating-system facilities for file creation, file
replacement, file locking, directory enumeration and cache flushing; those are
provided by the host operating system and are not distributed with this
repository.

Cooling Capacity Accounting does not collect or transmit any telemetry. Every
record it writes is written to local files chosen by the operator and never
leaves the machine running the software.

